ary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Using Modals with Expressions of Frequency"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could, would,</span> and <span class=\"italic\">should</span> with expressions of frequency to talk about preferences.<br/>The expression of frequency goes at the end of the sentence."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\"> Modals for Preference </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\"> Expressions of Frequency </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I would prefer to \u2026<br/>We should \u2026<br/>I would like to \u2026<br/>I'd rather ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">once a week<br/>every day<br/>more often <br/> twice a week\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Albert</span>: I'd like to eat pizza every day!<br/><span class = \"strong\">Brenda</span>: Me too, but I should practice yoga every week."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Albert</span>: We should play soccer once a week.<br/><span class = \"strong\">Brenda</span>: Good idea, but I would prefer to play more often."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to discover"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to find out; to learn something new"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are so many new restaurants to discover downtown!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about food and drinks."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a lot to offer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "many things you can do there"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Cambridge has a lot to offer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "diner"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a restaurant serving typical North American dishes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I feel like going to the Willow Diner."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "milkshake"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a drink made with milk foam and ice cream"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love strawberry milkshakes!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scrambled eggs"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a dish made of eggs beaten in a pan"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would love to eat scrambled eggs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get fat"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put on weight (not polite to say to someone else)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I shouldn't eat so many fries. I don't want to get fat!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le01ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of 5 restaurants in your neighborhood."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about the food in each place."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Would you like to go to these places more often?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the chart below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a sentence about each restaurant."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name of the Place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What kind of food is it?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you go there often?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you like to go there more often?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I use <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">would</span> and <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to express preference."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 5 sentences about going to a restaurant."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use expressions of frequency to talk about restaurants."}]}], "type": "sena"}